        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rYour target is Catherine Kenyon, an asset-stripping hedge fund manager. She is currently at the Milton Fitzpatrick bank in New York under the guise of opening a private account.\r\rHowever, her real motive is to steal a pricless antique stradivarius violin from the highly secure vault, which she can then turn and sell at a profit. This would get her millions of dollars, so our client has asked us to not only eliminate the target, but also retrieve the violin.\r\rHappy hunting.",
